40 NN c=M rel=WF-003,WF-008 | Hook mechanics: fingerprint and stop_hook_active handling.
41 XW m=M c=M rel=WF-003 | Stop block requires addressing each reminder or stating why it does not apply. No policy requires that response. Static reading (C10).
  s: The agent changes production code covered by existing tests and finishes: the oracle is satisfied; M1 blocks once until Claude addresses the reminder or states why it does not apply.
